      "raw_text": "Know Your Cybercriminal: Evaluating Attacker Preferences by Measuring Profile Sales on an Active, Leading Criminal Market for User Impersonation at Scale"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "tei:year",
      "source": "grobid_tei",
